## solution

#### depth first

```js
const leftyNodes = (root) => {
  const values = [];

  const traverse = (node, level) => {
    if (node === null) return;

    if (values[level] === undefined) values.push(node.val);

    traverse(node.left, level + 1);
    traverse(node.right, level + 1);
  };

  traverse(root, 0);
  return values;
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

