## solution

#### depth first

```cpp
void leftyNodes(Node* root, int level, std::vector<std::string> &values) {
  if (root == nullptr) {
    return;
  }

  if (values.size() == level) {
    values.push_back(root->val);
  }

  leftyNodes(root->left, level + 1, values);
  leftyNodes(root->right, level + 1, values);
}

std::vector<std::string> leftyNodes(Node* root) {
  std::vector<std::string> values;
  leftyNodes(root, 0, values);
  return values;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
